OL,3,GNEWSADUP party officers to meet to
OL,4,Adiscuss Drumcree next steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Unionist Party's (DUP)
OL,7,Fruling committee is to meet on Thursday
OL,8,Fto discuss what steps it takes after
OL,9,Fthe Drumcree parading dispute.
OL,11,FThe BBC understands there are two
OL,12,Foptions that the party will discuss -
OL,13,Fincluding collapsing the Northern
OL,14,FIreland Executive as early as next
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, a second DUP assembly member
OL,18,Fhas called for First Minister Michelle
OL,19,FO'Neill's removal from office.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
