OL,3,GNEWSADUP party officers to meet to
OL,4,Adiscuss Drumcree next steps
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaurice Bradley said removing O'Neill
OL,7,F"would not, in itself, require the
OL,8,FAssembly to collapse".
